     A                                      e.      :'
     A                                  7  2':'
     A                                  7 79':'
     A                                  8  2':   ADD     An "A" may be entered'
     A                                  8 36'in the transaction field to add ad-
     A                                      ditional :'
     A                                  9  2':'
     A                                  9 14'records (levels) to the schedule.'
     A                                  9 79':'
     A                                 10  2':   CHANGE  A "C" entered in the t-
     A                                      ransaction field followed by a spec-
     A                                      ific    :'
