     A                                  8  2': VALID EDIT CODES:'
     A                                  8 79':'
     A                                  9  2':    A  -  Start a move or copy on'
     A                                  9 37'the line after this line'
     A                                  9 79':'
     A                                 10  2':    B  -  End a move or copy on t-
     A                                      he line before this line'
